<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Kinokawa - (built 1982) 179,618 dwt sold for $10.5 million.</p>
<p>Adriatic Prestige - (built 1976) 23,947 dwt sold to Grek buyers for $2.1 million &quot;as is&quot;.</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS - Ocean Centaurus - (built 1983) sold to Greek buyers for $6.7 million on &quot;as is&quot; basis.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection,  survey or other conditions.</p>
